== the increment family returns the NEW value, not the old
  from 10, increment returns 11
  from 11, decrement returns 10
  variable ended at 10
  from 100, Add64(+7) returns 107
  from 107, Add64(-7) returns 100
== compare-and-swap, both outcomes and what is left behind
  matching swap returned true, value now 9
  mismatched swap returned false, value still 9
  ptr matching swap: true, now points at b: yes
  ptr mismatched swap: false, unchanged: yes
== under real contention
  atomic counter exact: yes
  spinlock-guarded counter exact: yes
  lock released: yes
done
